  ozelFonksiyon: 
  aciklama:
  - "Fincan\u0131n\u0131n \xE7eperleri metruk bir s\u0131\u011F\u0131na\u011F\u0131
    and\u0131r\u0131yor {{isim}}. Bu s\u0131\u011F\u0131na\u011F\u0131n \u0131ss\u0131z
    kuytular\u0131na \xE7ekilmi\u015F bir de insan fig\xFCr\xFC var. Telvelerinden
    anlad\u0131\u011F\u0131m kadar\u0131yla, bir t\xFCrl\xFC \xFCzerinden atamad\u0131\u011F\u0131n
    \"letarji ve yorgunluk\" y\xFCz\xFCnden kendi kabu\u011Funa \xE7ekilmi\u015Fsin.
    Zaman\u0131n i\xE7inden izole edebildi\u011Fin anlar\u0131, kendinden ba\u015Fkas\u0131na
    ay\u0131rmak istemedi\u011Fini anl\u0131yorum. Bu durumun getirdi\u011Fi su\xE7luluk
    ya da pi\u015Fmanl\u0131k hissiyat\u0131n\u0131 hemen \u015Fimdi, bu sat\u0131rlar\u0131
    okurken d\xFC\u015F\xFCncelerinden def edebilirsin. \xC7\xFCnk\xFC do\u011Fru
    yoldas\u0131n.\n\nFincan\u0131n orta kesimlerindeki telvelerinin koyula\u015Ft\u0131\u011F\u0131
    alanlar, geni\u015F bir \"vaha\" imgesiyle ferahlam\u0131\u015F. \U0001F3F5\uFE0F
    Kendi kendine ge\xE7irdi\u011Fin kaliteli zaman, {{sayi,8,12}} haftal\u0131k
    bir s\xFCre\xE7 i\xE7erisinde ruhsal ve bedensel s\u0131hhatini g\xF6zle g\xF6r\xFCl\xFCr
    \u015Fekilde art\u0131racak. \u0130\xE7 d\xFCnyana yapt\u0131\u011F\u0131n yolculu\u011Fu
    \"bencillik\" olarak addedip k\xF6t\xFC hissetme K\u0131ymetli {{soyisim}}. Zira
    bir tutam \"bencillik\" \xF6z sayg\u0131ya giden yolun kilit ta\u015F\u0131d\u0131r."
